What was the first brute force password used?
This hint was already revealed, I assume from taking so long so far:
Login attempts will use the HTTP POST method, and they will include some obvious fields that you can search for in the form_data field of stream:http events.
So I built my query around that, and this is what I came up with:
dest_ip=192.168.250.70 sourcetype="stream:http" "POST" "*pass*"
